    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d628">

                <pb facs="0969" n="951" sameAs="frus:frus1947v03/pg951"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 EW Peace/7–3147: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Embassy in Italy
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">u.s. urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-07-31T20:00:00-04:00">July 31, 1947—8
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1288. For the Ambassador. Brit Embassy has informed us that Brit Govt “on
                    financial and manpower grounds” has decided to withdraw Brit troops from Greece
                    and reduce those in Italy to the 5,000 provided for in Annex 7 of the Italian
                    treaty. Brit Embassy said that no announcement foregoing decision is being
                        made.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d628-f1"/>
                </p>
                <pb facs="0970" n="952" xml:id="pg952"/>
                <p>War Dept has been informed. Your comments on effect this decision in so far as it
                    applies to Italy are urgently desired.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d628-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
